@page "/about"

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Medium" Class="pa-4 mt-4">

    <!-- Rubrik över bilden -->
    <h1 class="page-title mb-4">About The Loading Bean</h1>

    <!-- Bildbanner -->
    <img src="/images/about.png" alt="About The Loading Bean" class="section-banner mb-4" />

    <!-- Textkort -->
    <div class="about-card slim-card">

        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
            Welcome to <strong>The Loading Bean</strong> – your nerdy oasis for coffee, tea, and accessories.
            Whether you’re grinding late in a dungeon, battling bugs in code, or just chilling with friends – we believe every quest deserves great coffee.
            Here, gamers, coders, streamers, and dreamers all find a place to recharge and feel at home.
        </MudText>

        <MudDivider Class="my-4" />

        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="font-weight-bold">
            Our Mission
        </MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">
            We aim to combine flavor, fun and function. Whether you need a 'Bug Fix Blend' to conquer a project, a 'Mana Brew' to power through a boss fight, or just a comforting cup to start your day – we’ve got you covered.
        </MudText>

        <MudDivider Class="my-4" />

        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="font-weight-bold">
            Powered by Passion
        </MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
            Crafted with heart, fueled by coffee, and inspired by the worlds of code and gaming.
            The Loading Bean is more than just a store – it’s a love letter to all of us who thrive on creativity, curiosity, and caffeine.
        </MudText>

        <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Class="quote">
            “Great code – and epic games – begin with great coffee.”
        </MudText>

    </div>
</MudContainer>